[{"title":"同深有上人看梅","author":"李贽","text":"东阁观梅去，清尊怨未开。\n徘徊天际暮，独与老僧来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":31205,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又观梅","author":"李贽","text":"雷雨惊春候，寒梅次第开。\n金陵有逸客，特地看花来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":31206,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郑楼","author":"李贽","text":"谷口郑子真，栖迟市门里。\n小楼延上客，酒酣犹未已。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":31207,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"薙发 其一","author":"李贽","text":"空潭一老丑，薙发便为僧。\n愿度恒沙众，长明日月灯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":31208,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"薙发 其二","author":"李贽","text":"有家真是累，混俗亦招尤。\n去去山中卧，晨兴粥一瓯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":31209,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"薙发 其三","author":"李贽","text":"为儒已半世，食禄又多年。\n欲证无生忍，尽抛妻子缘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":31210,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"薙发 其四","author":"李贽","text":"大定非关隐，魂清自可人。\n而今应度者，不是宰官身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":31211,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭贵儿 其一","author":"李贽","text":"水深能杀人，胡为浴于此。\n欲眠眠不得，今子于慈死。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":31212,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭贵儿 其二","author":"李贽","text":"不饮又不醉，子今有何罪。\n疾呼遂不应，痛恨此潭水。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":31213,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭贵儿 其三","author":"李贽","text":"骨肉归故里，童仆皆我弃。\n汝我如形影，今朝惟我矣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":31214,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭黄宜人 其一","author":"李贽","text":"结发为夫妇，恩情两不牵。\n今朝闻汝死，不觉情凄然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":31215,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭黄宜人 其二","author":"李贽","text":"不为恩情牵，含凄为汝贤。\n反目未曾有，齐眉四十年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":31216,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭黄宜人 其三","author":"李贽","text":"中表皆称孝，舅姑忍汝劳。\n宾朋日夜往，龟手事香醪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":31217,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭黄宜人 其四","author":"李贽","text":"慈心能割有，约已善持家。\n缘余贪佛去，别汝在天涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":31218,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭黄宜人 其五","author":"李贽","text":"近水观鱼戏，春山独鸟啼。\n贫交犹不有，何况糟糠妻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":31219,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭黄宜人 其六","author":"李贽","text":"冀缺与梁鸿，何人可比踪。\n丈夫志四海，恨汝不能从。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":31220,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜半闻雁 其一","author":"李贽","text":"孤鸿向北征，夜半犹哀鸣。\n哀鸣何所为，欲我如鸿冥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":31221,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜半闻雁 其二","author":"李贽","text":"自有凌霄翮，高飞安不得。\n如何万里行，反作淹留客。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":31222,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜半闻雁 其三","author":"李贽","text":"独雁虽无依，群飞尚有伴。\n可怜何处翁，兀坐生忧患。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":31223,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜半闻雁 其四","author":"李贽","text":"日月湖中久，时闻冀北音。\n鸿飞如我待，鼓翼向山阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":31224,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庄纯夫还闽有忆 其一","author":"李贽","text":"乘龙人归去，谁复到吾门。\n薄暮多风雨，知子宿前村。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":31225,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庄纯夫还闽有忆 其二","author":"李贽","text":"海物多奇错，砺房味正清。\n夫妻共食啖，不得到麻城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":31226,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庄纯夫还闽有忆 其三","author":"李贽","text":"三子皆聪明，必然早着声。\n若能举孝廉，取道过西陵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":31227,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庄纯夫还闽有忆 其四","author":"李贽","text":"七十古来稀，知余能几时。\n君宜善自计，莫念出家儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":31228,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岁暮过胡南老 其一","author":"李贽","text":"胡床挂空壁，穷巷有深居。\n满目繁华在，先生独晏如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":31229,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岁暮过胡南老 其二","author":"李贽","text":"河内着碑铭，睢塘流颂声。\n百年林下叟，隐隐作仪刑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":31230,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岁暮过胡南老 其三","author":"李贽","text":"四邻箫管沸，大都为岁除。\n君看五马贵，囊有一钱无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":31231,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岁暮过胡南老 其四","author":"李贽","text":"有席虽长穿，有朋亦喜欢。\n园蔬堪摘矣，不用一钱看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":31232,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"榼山寺夜坐","author":"李贽","text":"松风已可哀，萝月复飞来。\n如何当此夜，万里独登台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":31233,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郑子玄不顾雨雪之难走潞河欲寻旧交予惧其或有嗟来也故作诗三章以慰其行 其一","author":"李贽","text":"雨雪东南行，贫交家上京。\n当时孔北海，极重郑康成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":31234,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郑子玄不顾雨雪之难走潞河欲寻旧交予惧其或有嗟来也故作诗三章以慰其行 其二","author":"李贽","text":"四顾堪愁绝，连天一月雪。\n恐扺张家湾，难对贫交说。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":31235,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郑子玄不顾雨雪之难走潞河欲寻旧交予惧其或有嗟来也故作诗三章以慰其行 其三","author":"李贽","text":"贫贱少亲交，许由故弃瓢。\n许由千古少，蒙袂且相招。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe529429